{'symbol': 'TXT', 'date': '2023-04-25 12:00:00', 'title': 'TEXTRON AVIATION CELEBRATES MILESTONE 400TH DELIVERY FOR CESSNA CITATION CJ4 GEN2', 'text': "WICHITA, KAN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TEXTRON AVIATION TODAY ANNOUNCED THE DELIVERY OF ITS 400TH CITATION CJ4 SERIES AIRCRAFT TO KOCH HOLDINGS OF EASTON, PENNSYLVANIA. THIS MILESTONE DELIVERY FOR THE CESSNA CITATION CJ4 SERIES REINFORCES THE CITATION FAMILY AS THE WORLD'S MOST POPULAR LINE OF BUSINESS JETS AND DEMONSTRATES THE COMPANY'S COMMITMENT TO CONTINUED INNOVATION FOR CUSTOMERS AS EXEMPLIFIED IN THE LATEST CITATION CJ4 GEN2 AIRCRAFT. CESSNA CITATION JETS ARE DESIGNED AND MANUFACTURED BY TEXTRO."}